  "profiles": {
    "honest": "declares the domains where its base model passes at least declaration_threshold of map tasks; outcome = map",
    "boaster": "declares all seven domains; outcome = map of its base (a mild false claim: only Time and Network are below threshold for nano)",
    "impostor": "synthetic adversary: declares all seven domains, always fails, bills like its base; models an agent that claims skills and delivers nothing",
    "lazy": "declares like honest; with probability lazy_p returns an empty answer (failure) and still bills the call",
    "specialist": "declares only its listed domains and refuses tasks outside them (no cost; the requester re-selects, one extra message); inside them outcome = map",
    "unstable": "declares like honest; alternates phases of phase_length episodes: honest, then lazy with lazy_p, then honest, ...",
    "liar": "honest worker on its base; when asked for opinions about its contacts it reports successes and failures swapped (malicious recommender)"
